<!--
  Placeholder GoogleService-Info.plist with dummy values.

  This exists only so the project builds without depending on any external key
  store. The values are NOT real: Firebase services (push, crashlytics, etc.)
  will not actually work against this configuration.

  TOS does not use Firebase; removing the Firebase SDKs entirely is tracked as
  follow-up work. Until then, if you need working Firebase locally, drop your
  own GoogleService-Info.plist into Tonkeeper/Resources/Firebase/<Flavor>/
  (that directory is git-ignored).
-->
